# SecondBrain operations

Server-side infrastructure for the Obsidian SecondBrain.

- LiveSync service: `{{ secondbrain_service_dir }}`
- Public endpoint: `https://{{ secondbrain_domain }}:{{ secondbrain_https_port }}`
- CouchDB database/user: `{{ secondbrain_couchdb_database }}` / `{{ secondbrain_couchdb_user }}`
- CouchDB credentials: `{{ secondbrain_service_dir }}/.env` (root-only)
- Restic password: `{{ secondbrain_backup_config_dir }}/restic-password` (root-only)
- Upstream LiveSync commit: `{{ secondbrain_upstream_commit }}`

## Commands

```sh
sudo secondbrain-status
sudo systemctl start secondbrain-backup.service
sudo {{ secondbrain_ops_dir }}/bin/secondbrain-restore-test ssd latest
```

Do not expose raw CouchDB port 5984. It is bound to loopback only.

